o de pal\u00edndromo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cRadar\u201d \u00e9 um pal\u00edndromo; a palavra \u201cpal\u00edndromo\u201d tem origem no grego e significa \u201ccorrer de volta\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-adb4-7f2d-8dd7-eabc6222bbae","description":"Radar","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-712a-ba90-bf0f43276b29","description":"Smash","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-7a52-a505-41070fb7bb5c","description":"Internet","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-70c6-bf13-160830508e7b","description":"Foguete","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-7020-9718-44b288e97b44","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Qual \u00e9 o verbo que significa encurtar uma palavra ou frase omitindo letras?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Abreviar \u00e9 encurtar uma palavra ou frase; \u201cDr.\u201d \u00e9 uma forma abreviada convencional de \u201cdoutor\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-adb4-714f-9308-3dda17b3b4eb","description":"Abreviar","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-792b-8c6c-d71094881381","description":"Abolir","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-7e8b-8f9f-7a36858ef970","description":"Sequestrar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-76bd-8c48-f6715b82db5a","description":"Abominar","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-7d64-9982-106b769b9948","category":"01a21348-94aa-7eae-ba09-829334cba03f","question":"Qual palavra descreve algo que \u00e9 dif\u00edcil de ler, como uma caligrafia ruim?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cIleg\u00edvel\u201d significa que n\u00e3o est\u00e1 claro o suficiente para ser lido. \u201cInvis\u00edvel\u201d significa que n\u00e3o pode ser visto, enquanto \u201cil\u00edcito\u201d e \u201cilegal\u201d descrevem algo proibido pela lei ou pelas regras.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-adb4-77f4-9136-41b61a8546b6","description":"Ileg\u00edvel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-adb4-750e-b38d-bdb7ecac43a8","description":"Invis\u00edvel"